B.a8G=s(["\xc1brelo para elegir 42, Bloqueo, Domin\xf3 de robo, Tren Mexicano, Todos los cincos o Bergen, cada uno con sus propias reglas. Las capturas de abajo muestran el men\xfa y cada uno de sus juegos.","Ouvrez-le pour choisir 42, Bloqu\xe9, Pioche, Train mexicain, Tous les cinq ou Bergen, chacun avec ses propres r\xe8gles. Les captures ci-dessous montrent le menu et chacun de ses jeux.","\xd6ffne es, um 42, Block, Ziehen, Mexican Train, Alle F\xfcnfer oder Bergen mit jeweils eigenen Regeln zu w\xe4hlen. Die Screenshots unten zeigen das Men\xfc und jedes seiner Spiele.","Abra-o para escolher 42, Bloqueio, Compra, Trem Mexicano, Todos os cincos ou Bergen, cada um com suas pr\xf3prias regras. As capturas abaixo mostram o menu e cada um dos seus jogos.","\u958b\u304f\u3068\u3001\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u72ec\u81ea\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u6301\u306442\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30c9\u30ed\u30fc\u3001\u30e1\u30ad\u30b7\u30ab\u30f3\u30c8\u30ec\u30a4\u30f3\u3001\u30aa\u30fc\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30d6\u3001\u30d9\u30eb\u30b2\u30f3\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4e0b\u306e\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u3068\u305d\u306e\u4e2d\u306e\u5404\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0915\u0930 42, \u092c\u094d\u0932\u0949\u0915, \u0921\u094d\u0930\u093e, \u092e\u0948\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093f\u0915\u0928 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928, \u0911\u0932 \u092b\u093e\u0907\u0935\u094d\u0938 \u092f\u093e \u092c\u0930\u094d\u0917\u0947\u0928 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902, \u091c\u093f\u0928\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094d\u0930\u0940\u0928\u0936\u0949\u091f \u092e\u0947\u0928\u0942 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0939\u0930 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964","Buka untuk memilih 42, Blok, Tarik, Kereta Meksiko, Semua Lima, atau Bergen, masing-masing dengan aturannya sendiri. Tangkapan layar di bawah menunjukkan menu dan setiap game di dalamnya.","M\u1edf menu \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn 42, Ch\u1eb7n, R\xfat, T\xe0u Mexico, T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 s\u1ed1 n\u0103m ho\u1eb7c Bergen, m\u1ed7i tr\xf2 c\xf3 lu\u1eadt ri\xeang. \u1ea2nh ch\u1ee5p m\xe0n h\xecnh b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi l\xe0 menu v\xe0 t\u1eebng tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i trong \u0111\xf3."],t.s)
B.afj=s(["Domin\xf3 de bazas de Texas","Dominos \xe0 lev\xe9es du Texas","Texanisches Stichspiel mit Dominosteinen","Domin\xf3 de vazas do Texas","\u30c6\u30ad\u30b5\u30b9\u306e\u30c8\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u30c6\u30a4\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u30fb\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u0947\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u093e \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0915-\u091f\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino adu trik dari Texas","Domino \u0103n n\u01b0\u1edbc ki\u1ec3u Texas"],t.s)
B.amr=s(["Dos equipos de dos pujan en cada mano, quien puja m\xe1s alto elige el triunfo y las fichas de cuenta valen puntos extra. Cumple tu apuesta para ganar una marca.","Deux \xe9quipes de deux ench\xe9rissent \xe0 chaque donne, le plus offrant choisit l\u2019atout et les dominos de compte valent des points en plus. R\xe9alisez votre ench\xe8re pour gagner une marque.","Zwei Zweierteams bieten in jeder Runde, der H\xf6chstbietende bestimmt Trumpf, und die Z\xe4hlsteine bringen Extrapunkte. Erf\xfclle dein Gebot, um eine Marke zu gewinnen.","Duas duplas d\xe3o lances a cada m\xe3o, quem d\xe1 o maior lance escolhe o trunfo e as pedras de contagem valem pontos extras. Cumpra seu lance para ganhar uma marca.","2\u4eba1\u7d44\u306e2\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u6bce\u56de\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u3057\u3001\u6700\u9ad8\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u306e\u4eba\u304c\u5207\u308a\u672d\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u3001\u5f97\u70b9\u724c\u306f\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u70b9\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u3092\u9054\u6210\u3059\u308b\u3068\u30de\u30fc\u30af\u3092\u7372\u5f97\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0926\u094b-\u0926\u094b \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0926\u094b \u091f\u0940\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u092a\u0930 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u090a\u0901\u091a\u0940 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0902\u092a \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0909\u0902\u091f \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0924\u093f\u0930\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0915 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dua tim berisi dua orang menawar di setiap ronde, penawar tertinggi memilih truf, dan kartu hitungan bernilai poin tambahan. Penuhi tawaranmu untuk memenangkan satu tanda.","Hai \u0111\u1ed9i hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7t gi\xe1 m\u1ed7i v\xe1n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ea3 gi\xe1 cao nh\u1ea5t ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ee7 b\xe0i, v\xe0 c\xe1c qu\xe2n t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ed9ng th\xeam. \u0110\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ec3 gi\xe0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ed1c."],t.s)
B.aiD=s(["Domin\xf3 cl\xe1sico de unir extremos","Dominos classiques o\xf9 l\u2019on assortit les bouts","Klassisches Domino: Enden anlegen","Domin\xf3 cl\xe1ssico de combinar as pontas","\u7aef\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u5b9a\u756a\u306e\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0915 \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino klasik mencocokkan ujung","Domino c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n n\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u"],t.s)
B.agr=s(["Juega una ficha que coincida con un extremo abierto de la l\xednea. No se roba: si no puedes jugar, pasas. Qu\xe9date sin fichas primero para ganar la ronda.","Posez un domino qui correspond \xe0 un bout libre de la ligne. On ne pioche pas : si vous ne pouvez pas jouer, vous passez. Videz votre main en premier pour gagner la manche.","Lege einen Stein an, der zu einem offenen Ende der Reihe passt. Es wird nicht gezogen: Wer nicht legen kann, passt. Wer zuerst alle Steine los ist, gewinnt die Runde.","Jogue uma pedra que combine com uma ponta aberta da linha. N\xe3o se compra: se n\xe3o puder jogar, voc\xea passa. Acabe com suas pedras primeiro para vencer a rodada.","\u5217\u306e\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306b\u5408\u3046\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u306f\u5f15\u3051\u305a\u3001\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u30d1\u30b9\u3067\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306b\u624b\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u5207\u308b\u3068\u30e9\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0932 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940: \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0924\u094d\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0902\u0921 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Mainkan kartu yang cocok dengan ujung terbuka barisan. Tidak ada menarik kartu: jika tidak bisa main, kamu lewat. Habiskan kartumu lebih dulu untuk memenangkan ronde.","\u0110\u1eb7t qu\xe2n kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf c\u1ee7a h\xe0ng. Kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1c th\xeam: n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xec b\u1ecf l\u01b0\u1ee3t. \u0110\xe1nh h\u1ebft qu\xe2n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng v\xf2ng."],t.s)
B.ajb=s(["Domin\xf3 de unir extremos con robo","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on assortit les bouts, avec pioche","Domino: Enden anlegen, mit Ziehen","Domin\xf3 de combinar as pontas, com compra","\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u3051\u308b\u7aef\u3064\u306a\u304e\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino mencocokkan ujung dengan menarik kartu","Domino n\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u c\xf3 b\u1ed1c qu\xe2n"],t.s)
B.akC=s(["Juega una ficha que coincida con un extremo abierto de la l\xednea y roba del pozo hasta que puedas. Qu\xe9date sin fichas primero para ganar la ronda.","Posez un domino qui correspond \xe0 un bout libre de la ligne, et piochez jusqu\u2019\xe0 pouvoir jouer. Videz votre main en premier pour gagner la manche.","Lege einen Stein an, der zu einem offenen Ende der Reihe passt, und ziehe aus dem Vorrat, bis du kannst. Wer zuerst alle Steine los ist, gewinnt die Runde.","Jogue uma pedra que combine com uma ponta aberta da linha e compre do monte at\xe9 conseguir. Acabe com suas pedras primeiro para vencer a rodada.","\u5217\u306e\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306b\u5408\u3046\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u3001\u51fa\u305b\u308b\u307e\u3067\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306b\u624b\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u5207\u308b\u3068\u30e9\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0932 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0915 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u092f\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u0938\u0947 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0924\u094d\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0902\u0921 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Mainkan kartu yang cocok dengan ujung terbuka barisan, dan tarik dari tumpukan sampai bisa main. Habiskan kartumu lebih dulu untuk memenangkan ronde.","\u0110\u1eb7t qu\xe2n kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf c\u1ee7a h\xe0ng, v\xe0 b\u1ed1c t\u1eeb kho cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. \u0110\xe1nh h\u1ebft qu\xe2n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng v\xf2ng."],t.s)
B.aqa=s(["Domin\xf3 de construir trenes","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on construit des trains","Domino mit Z\xfcgen","Domin\xf3 de montar trens","\u5217\u8eca\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino membangun kereta","Domino x\u1ebfp t\xe0u"],t.s)
B.aky=s(["Construye tu propio tren desde el doble central o juega en el Tren Mexicano compartido. Si no puedes jugar, roba, y tu tren queda abierto para todos.","Construisez votre propre train \xe0 partir du double central, ou jouez sur le Train mexicain commun. Si vous ne pouvez pas jouer, piochez, et votre train s\u2019ouvre \xe0 tous.","Baue deinen eigenen Zug vom Doppelstein in der Mitte aus oder lege an den gemeinsamen Mexican Train an. Kannst du nicht legen, ziehst du, und dein Zug steht allen offen.","Monte seu pr\xf3prio trem a partir do duplo central ou jogue no Trem Mexicano compartilhado. Se n\xe3o puder jogar, compre, e seu trem fica aberto para todos.","\u4e2d\u592e\u306e\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u304b\u3089\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5217\u8eca\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u304b\u3001\u5171\u6709\u306e\u30e1\u30ad\u30b7\u30ab\u30f3\u30c8\u30ec\u30a4\u30f3\u306b\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5217\u8eca\u304c\u5168\u54e1\u306b\u958b\u653e\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092c\u0940\u091a \u0915\u0947 \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0901, \u092f\u093e \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e \u092e\u0948\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093f\u0915\u0928 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u0938\u092c\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0916\u0941\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964","Bangun keretamu sendiri dari balak di tengah, atau main di Kereta Meksiko bersama. Jika tidak bisa main, tarik kartu, dan keretamu terbuka untuk semua.","X\u1ebfp t\xe0u c\u1ee7a ri\xeang b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i \u1edf gi\u1eefa, ho\u1eb7c \u0111i v\xe0o T\xe0u Mexico chung. N\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, h\xe3y b\u1ed1c qu\xe2n, v\xe0 t\xe0u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1edf cho m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi."],t.s)
B.a6l=s(["Domin\xf3 de puntuar de cinco en cinco","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on marque par cinq","Domino mit F\xfcnferwertung","Domin\xf3 de pontuar de cinco em cinco","5\u306e\u500d\u6570\u3067\u5f97\u70b9\u3059\u308b\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a-\u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino skor kelipatan lima","Domino t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u1ed9i s\u1ed1 n\u0103m"],t.s)
B.a79=s(["Punt\xfaa cada vez que los extremos abiertos sumen un m\xfaltiplo de cinco. El primer doble se abre en cuatro direcciones. Llega primero a la puntuaci\xf3n objetivo para ganar.","Marquez chaque fois que les bouts libres totalisent un multiple de cinq. Le premier double s\u2019ouvre dans quatre directions. Atteignez le score vis\xe9 en premier pour gagner.","Punkte gibt es, wenn die offenen Enden zusammen ein Vielfaches von f\xfcnf ergeben. Der erste Doppelstein \xf6ffnet in vier Richtungen. Wer zuerst die Zielpunktzahl erreicht, gewinnt.","Pontue sempre que as pontas abertas somarem um m\xfaltiplo de cinco. O primeiro duplo se abre em quatro dire\xe7\xf5es. Chegue primeiro \xe0 pontua\xe7\xe3o-alvo para vencer.","\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306e\u5408\u8a08\u304c5\u306e\u500d\u6570\u306b\u306a\u308b\u305f\u3073\u306b\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306e\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u306f4\u65b9\u5411\u306b\u4f38\u3070\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5148\u306b\u76ee\u6a19\u70b9\u306b\u9054\u3057\u305f\u4eba\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u091c\u092c \u092d\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c \u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0915\u093e \u0917\u0941\u0923\u091c \u0939\u094b, \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0901\u0964 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u091a\u093e\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0913\u0930 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a\u0915\u0930 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dapatkan skor setiap kali ujung-ujung terbuka berjumlah kelipatan lima. Balak pertama terbuka ke empat arah. Capai skor target lebih dulu untuk menang.","Ghi \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ed7i khi t\u1ed5ng c\xe1c \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf l\xe0 b\u1ed9i s\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a n\u0103m. Qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean m\u1edf ra b\u1ed1n h\u01b0\u1edbng. V\u1ec1 \u0111\xedch \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ee5c ti\xeau tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng."],t.s)
B.ad4=s(["Domin\xf3 de puntuar con extremos iguales","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on marque avec des bouts \xe9gaux","Domino mit Wertung f\xfcr gleiche Enden","Domin\xf3 de pontuar com pontas iguais","\u4e21\u7aef\u304c\u305d\u308d\u3046\u3068\u5f97\u70b9\u3059\u308b\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u090f\u0915 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino skor ujung yang sama","Domino t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m khi hai \u0111\u1ea7u gi\u1ed1ng nhau"],t.s)
B.ad1=s(["Punt\xfaa cuando los dos extremos de la l\xednea muestren el mismo n\xfamero, y m\xe1s si un doble hace que sean tres. Roba si no puedes jugar. Llega primero a la puntuaci\xf3n objetivo para ganar.","Marquez quand les deux bouts de la ligne montrent le m\xeame nombre, et davantage quand un double en fait trois. Piochez si vous ne pouvez pas jouer. Atteignez le score vis\xe9 en premier pour gagner.","Punkte gibt es, wenn beide Enden der Reihe dieselbe Zahl zeigen, und mehr, wenn ein Doppelstein daraus drei macht. Ziehe, wenn du nicht legen kannst. Wer zuerst die Zielpunktzahl erreicht, gewinnt.","Pontue quando as duas pontas da linha mostrarem o mesmo n\xfamero, e mais quando um duplo fizer tr\xeas. Compre se n\xe3o puder jogar. Chegue primeiro \xe0 pontua\xe7\xe3o-alvo para vencer.","\u5217\u306e\u4e21\u7aef\u304c\u540c\u3058\u6570\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3068\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u3001\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u30673\u3064\u305d\u308d\u3046\u3068\u3055\u3089\u306b\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5148\u306b\u76ee\u6a19\u70b9\u306b\u9054\u3057\u305f\u4eba\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u091c\u092c \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0901, \u0914\u0930 \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u0938\u0947 \u0924\u0940\u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0924\u094b \u0914\u0930 \u091c\u093c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0926\u093e\u0964 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a\u0915\u0930 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dapatkan skor saat kedua ujung barisan menunjukkan angka yang sama, dan lebih banyak saat balak membuatnya jadi tiga. Tarik kartu jika tidak bisa main. Capai skor target lebih dulu untuk menang.","Ghi \u0111i\u1ec3m khi hai \u0111\u1ea7u h\xe0ng c\xf3 c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1, v\xe0 nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n khi qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i l\xe0m th\xe0nh ba. B\u1ed1c qu\xe2n n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. V\u1ec1 \u0111\xedch \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ee5c ti\xeau tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng."],t.s)
B.a9A=s(["\xc1brelo para elegir Hong Kong, Riichi, Chino oficial, Taiwan\xe9s, Sichuan o Solitario, cada uno con sus propias reglas. Las capturas de abajo muestran el men\xfa y cada uno de sus juegos.","Ouvrez-le pour choisir Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinois officiel, Ta\xefwanais, Sichuan ou Solitaire, chacun avec ses propres r\xe8gles. Les captures ci-dessous montrent le menu et chacun de ses jeux.","\xd6ffne es, um Hongkong, Riichi, Chinesisch (offiziell), Taiwanesisch, Sichuan oder Solit\xe4r mit jeweils eigenen Regeln zu w\xe4hlen. Die Screenshots unten zeigen das Men\xfc und jedes seiner Spiele.","Abra-o para escolher Hong Kong, Riichi, Chin\xeas oficial, Taiwan\xeas, Sichuan ou Paci\xeancia, cada um com suas pr\xf3prias regras. As capturas abaixo mostram o menu e cada um dos seus jogos.","\u958b\u304f\u3068\u3001\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u72ec\u81ea\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u6301\u3064\u9999\u6e2f\u5f0f\u3001\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u9ebb\u96c0\u3001\u4e2d\u56fd\u9ebb\u96c0\u3001\u53f0\u6e7e\u9ebb\u96c0\u3001\u56db\u5ddd\u9ebb\u96c0\u3001\u30bd\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4e0b\u306e\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u3068\u305d\u306e\u4e2d\u306e\u5404\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0915\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0902\u0917\u0915\u093e\u0902\u0917, \u0930\u0940\u091a\u0940, \u091a\u0940\u0928\u0940 \u0906\u0927\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0915, \u0924\u093e\u0907\u0935\u093e\u0928\u0940, \u0938\u093f\u091a\u0941\u0906\u0928 \u092f\u093e \u0938\u0949\u0932\u093f\u091f\u0947\u092f\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902, \u091c\u093f\u0928\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094d\u0930\u0940\u0928\u0936\u0949\u091f \u092e\u0947\u0928\u0942 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0939\u0930 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964","Buka untuk memilih Hong Kong, Riichi, Resmi Tiongkok, Taiwan, Sichuan, atau Solitaire, masing-masing dengan aturannya sendiri. Tangkapan layar di bawah menunjukkan menu dan setiap game di dalamnya.","M\u1edf menu \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn H\u1ed3ng K\xf4ng, Riichi, Trung Qu\u1ed1c ch\xednh th\u1ee9c, \u0110\xe0i Loan, T\u1ee9 Xuy\xean ho\u1eb7c X\u1ebfp h\xecnh, m\u1ed7i tr\xf2 c\xf3 lu\u1eadt ri\xeang. \u1ea2nh ch\u1ee5p m\xe0n h\xecnh b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi l\xe0 menu v\xe0 t\u1eebng tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i trong \u0111\xf3."],t.s)
B.ahv=s(["Mahjong canton\xe9s cl\xe1sico","Mahjong cantonais classique","Klassisches kantonesisches Mahjong","Mahjong canton\xeas cl\xe1ssico","\u5b9a\u756a\u306e\u5e83\u6771\u5f0f\u9ebb\u96c0","\u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u0948\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0928\u0940\u091c\u093c \u092e\u0939\u091c\u094b\u0902\u0917","Mahjong Kanton klasik","M\u1ea1t ch\u01b0\u1ee3c Qu\u1ea3ng \u0110\xf4ng c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n"],t.s)
B.apX=s(["Reclama pungs, kongs y chows, y cierra con cuatro combinaciones y una pareja que valgan al menos el m\xednimo de faan que elijas.","Annoncez pungs, kongs et chows, et terminez avec quatre combinaisons et une paire valant au moins le minimum de faan choisi.","Melde Pungs, Kongs und Chows und gehe mit vier S\xe4tzen und einem Paar aus, die mindestens die gew\xe4hlte Faan-Mindestzahl wert sind.","Pe\xe7a pungs, kongs e chows, e bata com quatro trincas e um par que valham pelo menos o m\xednimo de faan escolhido.","\u30dd\u30f3\u30fb\u30ab\u30f3\u30fb\u30c1\u30fc\u3067\u9cf4\u304d\u3001\u9078\u3093\u3060\u6700\u4f4e\u7ffb\u6570\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306e4\u9762\u5b501\u96c0\u982d\u3067\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092a\u0941\u0902\u0917, \u0915\u094b\u0902\u0917 \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u093e\u0909 \u0915\u093e \u0926\u093e\u0935\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0938\u0947\u091f \u0935 \u090f\u0915 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u0928\u0915\u093e \u092e\u0942\u0932\u094d\u092f \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u092b\u093c\u093e\u0928 \u091c\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0964","Klaim pung, kong, dan chow, lalu menang dengan empat set dan satu pasang yang bernilai paling sedikit faan minimum pilihanmu.","\u0102n pung, kong v\xe0 chow, r\u1ed3i \xf9 v\u1edbi b\u1ed1n b\u1ed9 v\xe0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\xf4i \u0111\u1ea1t \xedt nh\u1ea5t s\u1ed1 faan t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn."],t.s)
B.akb=s(["Mahjong japon\xe9s","Mahjong japonais","Japanisches Mahjong","Mahjong japon\xeas","\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u9ebb\u96c0","\u091c\u093e\u092a\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u092e\u0939\u091c\u094b\u0902\u0917","Mahjong Jepang","M\u1ea1t ch\u01b0\u1ee3c Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n"],t.s)
B.alv=s(["Gana con una mano que tenga al menos un yaku, declara Riichi cuando te falte una ficha y suma dora para una puntuaci\xf3n mayor.","Gagnez avec une main qui a au moins un yaku, d\xe9clarez Riichi quand il vous manque une tuile, et ajoutez des dora pour marquer plus.","Gewinne mit einer Hand mit mindestens einem Yaku, sage Riichi an, wenn dir ein Stein fehlt, und hole mit Dora mehr Punkte.","Ven\xe7a com uma m\xe3o que tenha pelo menos um yaku, declare Riichi quando faltar uma pe\xe7a e some dora para pontuar mais.","\u5f79\u30921\u3064\u4ee5\u4e0a\u3064\u3051\u3066\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u3001\u3042\u30681\u679a\u3067\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u3092\u5ba3\u8a00\u3057\u3001\u30c9\u30e9\u3067\u70b9\u6570\u3092\u4f38\u3070\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0915\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e \u090f\u0915 \u092f\u093e\u0915\u0942 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902, \u090f\u0915 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0926\u0942\u0930 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0930\u0940\u091a\u0940 \u0918\u094b\u0937\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0921\u094b\u0930\u093e \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947\u0902\u0964","Menang dengan tangan yang punya setidaknya satu yaku, umumkan Riichi saat tinggal satu kartu lagi, dan tambahkan dora untuk skor lebih besar.","\xd9 v\u1edbi b\xe0i c\xf3 \xedt nh\u1ea5t m\u1ed9t yaku, b\xe1o Riichi khi ch\u1ec9 c\xf2n thi\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t qu\xe2n, v\xe0 th\xeam dora \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec3m h\u01a1n."],t.s)
B.aiQ=s(["Reglas oficiales chinas","R\xe8gles officielles chinoises","Offizielle chinesische Regeln","Regras oficiais chinesas","\u4e2d\u56fd\u516c\u5f0f\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb","\u0906\u0927\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0915 \u091a\u0940\u0928\u0940 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e","Aturan resmi Tiongkok","Lu\u1eadt ch\xednh th\u1ee9c Trung Qu\u1ed1c"],t.s)
B.afD=s(["Una mano ganadora necesita al menos 8 puntos de la larga lista de combinaciones oficiales, as\xed que planea tu mano desde el principio.","Une main gagnante doit valoir au moins 8 points selon la longue liste des combinaisons officielles : pr\xe9parez votre main d\xe8s le d\xe9part.","Eine Gewinnhand braucht mindestens 8 Punkte aus der langen Liste offizieller Wertungsmuster, also plane deine Hand von Anfang an.","Uma m\xe3o vencedora precisa de pelo menos 8 pontos da longa lista de combina\xe7\xf5es oficiais, ent\xe3o planeje sua m\xe3o desde o in\xedcio.","\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u306b\u306f\u516c\u5f0f\u5f79\u306e\u9577\u3044\u4e00\u89a7\u304b\u30898\u70b9\u4ee5\u4e0a\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u6700\u521d\u304b\u3089\u624b\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u7acb\u3066\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002","\u091c\u0940\u0924\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u0915\u094b \u0906\u0927\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u092a\u0948\u091f\u0930\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u0932\u0902\u092c\u0940 \u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e 8 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f, \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964","Tangan pemenang butuh setidaknya 8 poin dari daftar panjang pola skor resmi, jadi rencanakan tanganmu sejak awal.","B\xe0i \xf9 c\u1ea7n \xedt nh\u1ea5t 8 \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u1eeb danh s\xe1ch d\xe0i c\xe1c m\u1eabu t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\xednh th\u1ee9c, n\xean h\xe3y t\xednh b\xe0i ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u."],t.s)
B.a7P=s(["Mahjong de diecis\xe9is fichas","Mahjong \xe0 seize tuiles","Mahjong mit sechzehn Steinen","Mahjong de dezesseis pe\xe7as","16\u679a\u306e\u9ebb\u96c0","\u0938\u094b\u0932\u0939 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u094b\u0902 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u092e\u0939\u091c\u094b\u0902\u0917","Mahjong enam belas kartu","M\u1ea1t ch\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u01b0\u1eddi s\xe1u qu\xe2n"],t.s)
B.amh=s(["Las manos tienen diecis\xe9is fichas, as\xed que cierras con cinco combinaciones y una pareja. Suma tai por tus combinaciones y alcanza el m\xednimo que elijas.","Les mains comptent seize tuiles : on termine avec cinq combinaisons et une paire. Marquez des tai pour vos combinaisons et atteignez le minimum choisi.","Eine Hand hat sechzehn Steine, du gehst also mit f\xfcnf S\xe4tzen und einem Paar aus. Sammle Tai f\xfcr deine Muster und erreiche die gew\xe4hlte Mindestzahl.","As m\xe3os t\xeam dezesseis pe\xe7as, ent\xe3o voc\xea bate com cinco trincas e um par. Marque tai pelas combina\xe7\xf5es e alcance o m\xednimo escolhido.","\u624b\u724c\u306f16\u679a\u306a\u306e\u3067\u30015\u9762\u5b501\u96c0\u982d\u3067\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f79\u3067\u53f0\u3092\u6570\u3048\u3001\u9078\u3093\u3060\u6700\u4f4e\u53f0\u6570\u3092\u6e80\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002","\u0939\u093e\u0925 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u0932\u0939 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f \u0906\u092a \u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0938\u0947\u091f \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0948\u091f\u0930\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0924\u093e\u0908 \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0941\u0906 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964","Tangan berisi enam belas kartu, jadi kamu menang dengan lima set dan satu pasang. Kumpulkan tai dari polamu dan capai minimum pilihanmu.","M\u1ed7i tay c\xf3 m\u01b0\u1eddi s\xe1u qu\xe2n, n\xean b\u1ea1n \xf9 v\u1edbi n\u0103m b\u1ed9 v\xe0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\xf4i. Ghi tai theo m\u1eabu b\xe0i v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn."],t.s)
B.a5_=s(["Mahjong de tres palos","Mahjong \xe0 trois familles","Mahjong mit drei Farben","Mahjong de tr\xeas naipes","3\u7a2e\u985e\u306e\u6570\u724c\u3060\u3051\u306e\u9ebb\u96c0","\u0924\u0940\u0928 \u0938\u0942\u091f \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u092e\u0939\u091c\u094b\u0902\u0917","Mahjong tiga jenis","M\u1ea1t ch\u01b0\u1ee3c ba ch\u1ea5t"],t.s)
B.a8x=s(["Solo c\xedrculos, bamb\xfaes y caracteres, sin chows. Elige un palo vac\xedo al empezar y deshazte de \xe9l para ganar.","Seulement ronds, bambous et caract\xe8res, sans chows. Choisissez une famille \xe0 vider au d\xe9but et d\xe9barrassez-vous-en pour gagner.","Nur Kreise, Bambus und Zeichen, ohne Chows. W\xe4hle zu Beginn eine Fehlfarbe und werde sie los, um zu gewinnen.","S\xf3 c\xedrculos, bambus e caracteres, sem chows. Escolha um naipe vazio no in\xedcio e livre-se dele para vencer.","\u7b52\u5b50\u30fb\u7d22\u5b50\u30fb\u842c\u5b50\u306e\u307f\u3067\u30c1\u30fc\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306b\u6b20\u3051\u308b\u8272\u3092\u9078\u3073\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3092\u624b\u653e\u3057\u3066\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0938\u093f\u0930\u094d\u092b\u093c \u0921\u0949\u091f\u094d\u0938, \u092c\u093e\u0902\u0938 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0948\u0930\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f\u0930, \u091a\u093e\u0909 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e\u0964 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0941\u0906\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0916\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0938\u0942\u091f \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0909\u0938\u0947 \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0902\u0964","Hanya bulatan, bambu, dan karakter, tanpa chow. Pilih jenis kosong di awal dan buang semuanya untuk menang.","Ch\u1ec9 c\xf3 \u0111\u1ed3ng, tr\xfac v\xe0 v\u1ea1n, kh\xf4ng c\xf3 chow. Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t b\u1ecf khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\xe0 lo\u1ea1i h\u1ebft ch\u1ea5t \u0111\xf3 \u0111\u1ec3 \xf9."],t.s)
B.a65=s(["Solitario de emparejar fichas","Solitaire d\u2019association de tuiles","Solit\xe4r mit Steinpaaren","Paci\xeancia de combinar pe\xe7as","\u724c\u3092\u5408\u308f\u305b\u308b\u30bd\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u30a2","\u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0938\u0949\u0932\u093f\u091f\u0947\u092f\u0930","Solitaire mencocokkan kartu","X\u1ebfp h\xecnh gh\xe9p c\u1eb7p qu\xe2n"],t.s)
B.ajI=s(["Empareja fichas libres para despejar el dise\xf1o de tortuga, pir\xe1mide o fortaleza. Deshaz o baraja si te atascas.","Associez les tuiles libres par paires pour vider la tortue, la pyramide ou la forteresse. Annulez ou m\xe9langez si vous \xeates bloqu\xe9.","Bilde Paare aus freien Steinen, um die Schildkr\xf6te, Pyramide oder Festung abzur\xe4umen. Mache r\xfcckg\xe4ngig oder mische, wenn du feststeckst.","Combine pe\xe7as livres em pares para limpar a tartaruga, a pir\xe2mide ou a fortaleza. Desfa\xe7a ou embaralhe se ficar sem jogadas.","\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u724c\u30922\u679a\u305a\u3064\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3001\u4e80\u30fb\u30d4\u30e9\u30df\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u8981\u585e\u306e\u914d\u7f6e\u3092\u7247\u4ed8\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002\u624b\u8a70\u307e\u308a\u306a\u3089\u623b\u3059\u304b\u30b7\u30e3\u30c3\u30d5\u30eb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0915\u091b\u0941\u0906, \u092a\u093f\u0930\u093e\u092e\u093f\u0921 \u092f\u093e \u0915\u093f\u0932\u093e \u0932\u0947\u0906\u0909\u091f \u0938\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u090f\u0901\u0964 \u0905\u091f\u0915\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093e\u092a\u0938 \u0932\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u092b\u0947\u0902\u091f\u0947\u0902\u0964","Cocokkan kartu bebas berpasangan untuk membersihkan susunan kura-kura, piramida, atau benteng. Batalkan atau kocok saat buntu.","Gh\xe9p c\xe1c qu\xe2n t\u1ef1 do th\xe0nh c\u1eb7p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ecdn b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c r\xf9a, kim t\u1ef1 th\xe1p ho\u1eb7c ph\xe1o \u0111\xe0i. Ho\xe0n t\xe1c ho\u1eb7c x\xe1o l\u1ea1i khi b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t."],t.s)
B.atj=new A.bJ(["T-G-Apps Game Catalog",B.ajn,"Visual HTML version: 2026-10-01A",B.afn,"Three apps and eighteen games: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard.",B.acs,"Six classic card games in one app, from partnership trick-taking and contract play to draw-and-discard and pegging. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.a5J,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage.",B.aeP,"6 games",B.aiP,"Visual HTML version: 2026-09-30A",B.amA,"Three apps and twenty games: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard.",B.a69,"In Every T-G-Apps Game",B.ahg,"Robot players.",B.aeU,"Fill any seat with a robot. Every game\u2019s robots play real strategy, not random moves, so a table is ready whenever you are \u2014 alone or with friends.",B.ant,"Hint system.",B.ac6,"Not sure what to do? Tap Hint for the play the robots would make and the reason behind it. It is the fastest way to learn a new game or sharpen your strategy.",B.aon,"Multi-lingual.",B.ahX,"Every game, menu and rule book is available in English, Spanish, French, German, Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, Hindi, Indonesian and Vietnamese. Switch languages at any time.",B.a5N,"Multiphone play.",B.ao5,"Play together on your own phones: one phone creates a room and shares a six-character code, and friends join from wherever they are. Each phone sees only its own cards.",B.ao8,"Audience Policy",B.rH,u.C,B.rK,"T-G-Apps Casino",B.abT,"Casino card games",B.aiS,"Eight casino favorites in one app: blackjack, four kinds of poker, and three house-banked table games. Every table plays with simulated chips and a bankroll that carries from hand to hand, so you can practice strategy, try a new game, or just enjoy a night at the tables without spending real money.",B.an_,"Games: 21, Texas Hold'em, 7 Card Draw, 7 Card Stud, 5 Card Draw, Baccarat, Let It Ride, Caribbean Stud.",B.a6o,"Ages 13+",B.rJ,"Simulated betting",B.rv,"8 games",B.akx,"21",B.a99,"Blackjack",B.aqO,"Classic blackjack against the dealer, with hit, stand, double, split, surrender and insurance, and configurable table rules. The hint shows the basic-strategy play for every hand.",B.amR,"During a hand",B.ai6,"Game menu",B.agt,"Showdown",B.amH,"Texas Hold'em",B.a4U,"Community-card poker",B.agy,"Two hole cards, five community cards and four betting rounds, in no-limit, pot-limit or fixed-limit play, with blinds and optional antes.",B.afy,"7 Card Draw",B.a8Y,"Draw poker",B.adm,"Seven private cards, a round of betting, one draw to improve, and the best five cards win.",B.a5f,"7 Card Stud",B.a8C,"Stud poker",B.aeN,"Fixed-limit seven-card stud with antes, a bring-in, and a mix of face-down and face-up cards dealt across five streets.",B.ac5,"5 Card Draw",B.aj1,"The classic: ante up, bet, draw up to three new cards, bet again and show down.",B.ak5,"Baccarat",B.ajK,"Punto banco",B.a52,"Bet on the Player, the Banker or a Tie, then watch the cards follow the traditional third-card rules. Six- or eight-deck shoes, with or without the banker commission.",B.ajM,"Let It Ride",B.aiV,"Table poker against the pay table",B.ajT,"Place three equal bets, see three cards, and pull back up to two bets as the two community cards are revealed. A pair of tens or better pays, up to 1,000 to 1 for a royal flush.",B.a8b,"Caribbean Stud",B.aeu,"Table poker against the dealer",B.a6T,"Ante, look at five cards and one dealer card, then fold or raise. The dealer must qualify with ace-king or better, and big hands pay up to 100 to 1 on the raise.",B.aaw,"T-G-Apps House of Cards",B.ahe,"Classic card games",B.aje,"Eight of the world\u2019s best-loved card games at one table: trick-taking games for partners and for going it alone, and the great melding games. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.ae1,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage, Pinochle, Canasta, Euchre.",B.amY,"Children &amp; Adults",B.rB,"No wagering",B.rP,"Hearts",B.abH,"Trick-taking",B.a9j,"Pass three cards, then avoid taking hearts and the queen of spades \u2014 unless you can take them all and shoot the moon.",B.ahc,"Spades",B.aam,"Partnership trick-taking",B.aij,"Bid the tricks you and your partner will take, with spades always trump. Watch your bags, and go nil when the cards are right.",B.amL,"Bridge",B.a5G,"Contract bridge",B.a7K,"Bid to a contract with your partner, then declare or defend with the dummy face up on the table. Played in sets of four deals with rotating vulnerability.",B.acZ,"Rummy",B.afR,"Draw and discard",B.aid,"Draw, meld sets and runs, lay off on the table, and be first to go out while your opponents are caught holding cards.",B.aj3,"Cribbage",B.abJ,"Pegging and counting",B.ane,"Discard to the crib, peg to fifteen and thirty-one, then count fifteens, pairs, runs, flushes and nobs in the show. First to 121 wins.",B.aqX,"Pinochle",B.ag8,"Partnership bidding and meld",B.abW,"Bid for trump, show your meld \u2014 marriages, runs, pinochles and arounds \u2014 then win the counters in the tricks to make your bid.",B.abx,"Canasta",B.adC,"Partnership melding",B.anS,"Draw, take the pile, and build melds of the same rank with your partner. Seven cards make a canasta; wild cards and red threes change everything.",B.ajd,"Euchre",B.a9c,"A fast five-card game: order up or call trump, remember the bowers, and take three tricks \u2014 or go alone for all five.",B.a6Q,"T-G-Apps Boneyard",B.a80,"Dice and tile games",B.aeH,"Dice and tiles for every age: two dice games, a full set of dominoes, and six ways to play mahjong. Shake, draw from the boneyard, or build a winning hand, against the robots or friends and family on their own phones.",B.aaP,"Games: YZ, Farkle, Dominoes, Mahjong.",B.ar8,"4 games",B.abG,"YZ",B.a4Y,"Dice scorecard strategy",B.rF,"Roll five dice up to three times a turn and choose where to score: the upper section, three and four of a kind, full houses, straights and five of a kind.",B.aeb,"Farkle",B.abX,"Push-your-luck dice",B.a5V,"Set aside scoring dice and keep rolling to build your turn total \u2014 but roll nothing that scores and you farkle and lose it all. First to 10,000 wins.",B.a5I,"Dominoes",B.aih,"Domino tile games",B.aaV,"Mahjong",B.aaN,"Mahjong tile games",B.aeV,"Six ways to play: Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan and Solitaire, with calls for pungs, kongs and chows and each style\u2019s own scoring.",B.aiL,u.q,B.rx,"Skip to catalog",B.aea,"Card, Dice &amp; Tile Games",B.aha,"Explore T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard. Dice Games, Rummy, Dominoes and Mahjong open menus of related games.",B.a4E,"Casino",B.apM,"House of Cards",B.an7,"Boneyard",B.apI,"Player 1, who sets up the game, is always a human; fill any other seat with a robot. Players on other phones are always human. Every game&rsquo;s robots play real strategy, not random moves, so a table is ready whenever you are &mdash; alone or with friends.",B.adO,"Casino Games and Local Laws",B.ajQ,"Our casino games use simulated chips. They do not offer real-money gambling, prizes of real-world value, or cash-out.",B.aik,"Availability varies by location:",B.a9F,"simulated gambling can be restricted in some countries even when no real money can be won. Local laws and age requirements may apply.",B.a6V,"House of Cards and Boneyard feature non-wagering card, dice and tile games for children and adults.",B.aqN,"Subject to local age restrictions",B.afr,"Classic card games and a Rummy game menu in one app, from partnership trick-taking, contract play and meld to draw-and-discard, canastas and pegging. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.aqe,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage, Pinochle, Canasta.",B.aoc,"8 game entries, including the Rummy menu",B.ajW,"Rummy game collection",B.ams,"Rummy is a game-selection menu.",B.aql,"Open it to choose among related rummy games, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.aaQ,"Dice Games",B.afP,"Dice game collection",B.anr,"Dice Games is a game-selection menu.",B.acU,"Open it to choose YZ or Farkle, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.ajY,"3 game menus",B.acG,"Menu of related games",B.anV,"Bidding, meld and tricks",B.afl,"Bid for the right to name trump, show your meld &mdash; marriages, runs, pinochles and arounds &mdash; then take tricks to win the counters. Partners must make the bid or go set. First team to 1500 wins.",B.ahF,"Hand recap",B.aq_,"Partnership draw, meld and canastas",B.acN,"Draw from the stock or take the whole discard pile, meld sets of the same rank with your partner, and build canastas &mdash; melds of seven cards. Wild cards help, but they freeze the pile. First team to 5000 wins.",B.abb,"Domino game collection",B.aoM,"Dominoes is a game-selection menu.",B.aqr,"Mahjong game collection",B.aof,"Mahjong is a game-selection menu.",B.alG,"Choose Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan or Solitaire. Each selection opens its own game and rules.",B.a4z,"Back to top",B.aip,"Visual HTML version: 2026-10-12B",B.a9x,"Our 3 Apps",B.aat,"Each app has its own games. Tap a name to jump to it.",B.a5e,"Six domino games in one: 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives and Bergen \u2014 bid and take tricks in 42; in the others, match the open ends, draw from the boneyard when you are stuck, and be first to play out your hand.",B.aom,"Choose 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives or Bergen, then start that game with its own rules.",B.abZ,"42",B.alb,"Block",B.aa8,"Draw",B.aoX,"Mexican Train",B.a6j,"All Fives",B.a73,"Bergen",B.ari,"Hong Kong",B.aes,"Riichi",B.af3,"Chinese Official",B.ah9,"Taiwanese",B.a6Z,"Sichuan",B.aqF,"Solitaire",B.ag6,"Gin Rummy",B.alg,"Rummy 500",B.a5v,"Contract Rummy",B.amc,"Indian Rummy",B.a5x,"Open it to choose 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives or Bergen, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.a8G,"Texas trick-taking dominoes",B.afj,"Two teams of two bid on each hand, the high bidder names trumps, and the count tiles are worth extra points. Make your bid to win a mark.",B.amr,"Classic match-the-ends dominoes",B.aiD,"Play a tile that matches an open end of the line. There is no drawing: if you cannot play, you pass. Play out your hand first to win the round.",B.agr,"Match-the-ends dominoes with drawing",B.ajb,"Play a tile that matches an open end of the line, and draw from the boneyard until you can. Play out your hand first to win the round.",B.akC,"Train-building dominoes",B.aqa,"Build your own train out from the hub double, or play on the shared Mexican Train. If you cannot play, draw, and your train opens to everyone.",B.aky,"Score-by-fives dominoes",B.a6l,"Score whenever the open ends of the layout add up to a multiple of five. The first double opens four ways. Reach the target score first to win.",B.a79,"Matching-ends scoring dominoes",B.ad4,"Score when both ends of the line show the same number, and more when a double makes three. Draw when you cannot play. Reach the target score first to win.",B.ad1,"Open it to choose Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan or Solitaire, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.a9A,"Classic Cantonese mahjong",B.ahv,"Claim pungs, kongs and chows, and go out with four sets and a pair worth at least the minimum faan you choose.",B.apX,"Japanese mahjong",B.akb,"Win with a hand that has at least one yaku, declare Riichi when you are one tile away, and add dora for a bigger score.",B.alv,"Official Chinese rules",B.aiQ,"A winning hand needs at least 8 points from the long list of official scoring patterns, so plan your hand from the start.",B.afD,"Sixteen-tile mahjong",B.a7P,"Hands hold sixteen tiles, so you go out with five sets and a pair. Score tai for your patterns and reach the minimum you choose.",B.amh,"Three-suit mahjong",B.a5_,"Only dots, bamboo and characters, with no chows. Choose a void suit at the start and get rid of it to win.",B.a8x,"Tile-matching solitaire",B.a65,"Match free tiles in pairs to clear the turtle, pyramid or fortress layout. Undo or shuffle when you are stuck.",B.ajI],A.a5("bJ<q,O<q>>"))
